Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Perilous Thorn Forest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 6
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.25,0:00:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn’t you say you could defeat monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.81,0:00:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,monster come out to cause trouble again, it’s all your fault
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.12,0:00:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,See it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t defeat the monster at all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Giving Bulala is the best solution
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.07,0:00:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone better catch him
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.51,0:00:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,obey
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.63,0:00:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But without Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.59,0:00:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Our losses may be even greater
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.26,0:01:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry Sparky asked us to wait here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.70,0:01:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a reason
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.91,0:01:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.67,0:01:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.59,0:01:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m fine
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.67,0:01:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you Spar—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.83,0:01:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.44,0:01:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t get me wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.39,0:01:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually have a requirement to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.43,0:01:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to help me find the legendary Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.71,0:01:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Bulala
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Father said
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.04,0:01:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Golden Bulala is hidden deep in the Thorn Forest
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just finding it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,can become stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.48,0:01:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,By then
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.12,0:01:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We can use it to defeat monster
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There is such a magical thing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.51,0:01:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.47,0:01:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you choose me to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I’m just like you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.72,0:01:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We both think monster is the key to all this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.64,0:01:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.72,0:01:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I admire your courage and responsibility to fight against monster alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:01:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, please let me go with you to find this Golden Bulala.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you? Will you come along?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.00,0:02:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you want to come
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.28,0:02:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren’t for you just now
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.64,0:02:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We would suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This adventure will definitely give you more courage
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,As you like
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.10,0:02:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m coming too
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go quickly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.22,0:02:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise my disguise will be discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.78,0:02:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,After we complete the task
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.74,0:02:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I will immediately find a way to restore your body
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.64,0:02:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.40,0:02:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How to get in
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.92,0:02:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Through my observations over the years
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.32,0:02:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In the Thorn Forest whenever there is sunshine on a sunny day
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.52,0:02:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The thorns will grow wildly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.32,0:02:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,On cloudy days, the thorns will shrink back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.59,0:02:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don’t we come in the evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There will be thick fog in the Thorn Forest at night
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.59,0:03:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s even more impossible to get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.82,0:03:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It turns out there is such a rule
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait until the cloud covers the sun
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We can use this time to get through the thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.52,0:03:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then just wait for the cloud to come
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.60,0:03:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don’t you sit with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.67,0:03:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m afraid he won’t be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s wrong with you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.59,0:03:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your relationship?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.07,0:03:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that he is your long-lost brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.92,0:03:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and you started quarreling over the future throne?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,no
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.03,0:03:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Not brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.87,0:03:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What grudges do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.63,0:03:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,enough
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.84,0:03:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I say okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.48,0:03:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since I was little, I have longed to get out of the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:04:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Frustrated by the rules of the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.23,0:04:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I can only stay in the palace all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.87,0:04:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,one day
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.31,0:04:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose ball is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, I accidentally threw it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.19,0:04:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you playing ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.80,0:04:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for accidentally throwing the ball in
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.32,0:04:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m the only one playing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.20,0:04:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I play with you then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything fun outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.32,0:04:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There are so many
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.76,0:04:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be nice if I could go out and take a look
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.92,0:04:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you just pen pals?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When will we meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.92,0:04:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,that day
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.95,0:05:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this? Is it an assassin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.30,0:05:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.18,0:05:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you said you wanted to come out and take a look
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I, I—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like this we played together
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what we played at that time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.75,0:05:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,we would always be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.07,0:05:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,we became best friends
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,until
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.34,0:05:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to the Thorn Forest
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:05:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to find the Golden Bulala that Father told me about
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.70,0:06:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you go in and find it with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.64,0:06:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.91,0:06:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And I will definitely protect you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.71,0:06:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The Thorn Forest doesn’t seem that scary after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.36,0:06:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let’s leave soon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.39,0:06:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do these thorns suddenly grow so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.87,0:06:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky I’ll pull you out
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.71,0:06:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,it hurts
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.03,0:07:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky I’m going to find someone to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.72,0:07:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m waiting for you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.24,0:07:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,friend
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the one who asked you to save me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.13,0:07:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,how is he
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.72,0:07:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,who
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.72,0:07:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is looking for us
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.44,0:07:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,we found you missing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.12,0:07:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We looked for you everywhere
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.68,0:07:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally found you lying alone in a Thorn Forest
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.09,0:07:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie he didn’t come back to save me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.29,0:07:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe there’s some misunderstanding there
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.61,0:07:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, I thought he had some difficulties
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But I just waited for his
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.82,0:07:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,that is
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.69,0:07:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t look for you again in the future
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.41,0:08:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Since he chose to be
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.96,0:08:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,a coward who abandons his friends
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I don’t have to cling to this friendship anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.93,0:08:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn’t go back to save him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.97,0:08:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky and I went to the Thorn Forest
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,he was trapped
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.29,0:08:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me to save him together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.21,0:08:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A noble prince would be with someone like you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.68,0:08:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,and play in the Thorn Forest
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Still trapped by thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, go, don’t lie here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.26,0:08:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We guard the city gate
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.86,0:08:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We don’t know how the prince could have gone out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.57,0:08:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince plays with you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.96,0:08:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you so timid to go to the Thorn Forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.72,0:09:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If no one helps me, I will save him by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.85,0:09:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Sparky?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.29,0:09:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that someone took the prince to the Thorn Forest
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.77,0:09:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s too bold, right? It’s fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that he seriously injured the prince. Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the person?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.22,0:09:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have escaped
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were the prince, I would hate him very much
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.97,0:09:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.45,0:09:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.30,0:09:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You harmed the prince and you harmed us and were punished
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.10,0:09:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Go go go. The prince said he doesn’t want to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.21,0:10:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I will never look for you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,since then
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.50,0:10:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We never met again
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.70,0:10:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There might be a misunderstanding
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.82,0:10:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You should explain it clearly in person
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.33,0:10:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,He won’t want to see me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.53,0:10:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But he doesn’t seem that angry with you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.81,0:10:19.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, he wouldn’t let you follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.52,0:10:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,why don’t you be brave
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.40,0:10:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The clouds are coming
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.17,0:10:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,quick
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be when this cloud covers the sun
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,rush over
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.48,0:10:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s go
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,not good
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy Wolffy, wait for me
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.38,0:11:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will definitely save you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.06,0:11:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,save you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.58,0:11:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.47,0:11:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t want you to get hurt anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.15,0:11:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sparky
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.27,0:11:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, run away
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.64,0:11:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, I have you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.04,0:11:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Bulala Weslie
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.48,0:12:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you three talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.48,0:12:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,keep walking
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,three
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He already considers you a partner
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.43,0:12:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s move on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.64,0:12:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I am coming
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
